{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S13把“想听对方说以后不变”写成了“已经听到对方说以后不变”，凭空增加了对方的承诺，改变了情节；S11也略微改变了人物动机。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点放大和话语分段，让观众即使不逐字读，也比较容易抓住每段人物心理发生了什么变化；感受文字又能跟随音乐具体展开，情绪层次和身体感受比Y细腻。Y的优势是叙述自然完整，人物为什么犹豫、为什么转变交代得更充分，前后心理逻辑也更稳，尤其S13没有改变原本的情节。综合边听边扫的实际体验，我选X，但它需要修正个别叙事偏差。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9c36917e-02bd-4726-9220-d99a2b8263e3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T001220429643Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:13:56.997063+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "376b1b7f353a6ef9bdadaac79db645953ebb17cfdac47bc7e6862a00f07734d9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachm